rains Close\",\"storySummary\":\"GENERAL COMMENTS:December corn closed down 3 3/4 cents and March corn was down 4 1/2 cents. November soybeans closed down 1 3/4 cents and January soybeans were down 2 cents. December KC wheat closed down 9 cents, December Chicago wheat was down 9 1/2 cents, December MIAX Minneapolis wheat was down 9 1/2 cents.The U.S.\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-10-16T18:51:00Z\",\"product\":null,\"author\":null,\"thumbNailImage\":null,\"cmsCategoryId\":null,\"dtnpfUrl\":\"https://www.dtnpf.com/agriculture/web/ag/news/article/2026/10/16/aghost-grains-close\",\"language\":\"en\",\"topic\":\"DTN/Ag/Markets\"},{\"id\":\"59db3a51-3491-4ffe-b86c-c0fdab2fabc8__603889\",\"links\":{\"article\":{\"href\":\"/publishing/news/articles/59db3a51-3491-4ffe-b86c-c0fdab2fabc8__603889\"}},\"title\":\"Hansen-Mueller Cash Freeze Sought\",\"subTitle\":\"Hansen-Mueller Funds Targeted in Sureties' Federal Appeal Fight\",\"storySummary\":\"Surety companies asked a Nebraska bankruptcy court to halt Hansen-Mueller cash distributions, arguing an appeal over $7.9 million in grain proceeds could be undermined.\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-10-16T17:48:00Z\",\"product\":null,\"author\":{\"name\":\"Todd Neeley\"},\"thumbNailImage\":{\"name\":\"231009-bryant-farms-57.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://www.dtnpf.com/mydtn-public-core-portlet/servlet/GetStoredImage?category=CMS&symbolicName=231009-bryant-farms-57.jpg\",\"caption\":\"Bonding companies are asking for a bankruptcy court to not approve Hansen-Mueller cash distributions. (DTN file photo)\"},\"cmsCategoryId\":null,\"dtnpfUrl\":\"https://www.dtnpf.com/agriculture/web/ag/news/business-inputs/article/2026/10/16/hansen-mueller-funds-targeted-appeal\",\"language\":\"en\",\"topic\":\"DTN/Ag/Business\"},{\"id\":\"6d0349fd-ef32-425b-a0ec-038e06f8ae82__603877\",\"links\":{\"article\":{\"href\":\"/publishing/news/articles/6d0349fd-ef32-425b-a0ec-038e06f8ae82__603877\"}},\"title\":\"Family Business Matters\",\"subTitle\":\"Family Business Successi