Corn futures are 4 to 5 cents lower at midday, soybeans are 6 to 7 cents lower, and wheat futures are 9 to 12 cents lower. The U.S. stock market is mixed at midday with the S&amp;P 25 points lower. The dollar index is 35 points lower.\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-10-16T15:55:00Z\",\"product\":null,\"author\":null,\"thumbNailImage\":null,\"cmsCategoryId\":null,\"dtnpfUrl\":\"https://www.dtnpf.com/agriculture/web/ag/news/article/2026/10/16/dtn-ag-host-midday-grains\",\"language\":\"en\",\"topic\":\"DTN/Ag\"},{\"id\":\"07025ECC\",\"links\":{\"article\":{\"href\":\"/publishing/news/articles/07025ECC\"}},\"title\":\"US Direct Feeder Pigs\",\"subTitle\":\"US Direct Feeder Pigs\",\"storySummary\":null,\"publishDate\":\"2026-10-16T15:20:16Z\",\"product\":null,\"author\":null,\"thumbNailImage\":null,\"cmsCategoryId\":null,\"dtnpfUrl\":\"\",\"language\":\"en\",\"topic\":\"DTN/Ag\"},{\"id\":\"07027DE9\",\"links\":{\"article\":{\"href\":\"/publishing/news/articles/07027DE9\"}},\"title\":\"Cotton AWP/LDP\",\"subTitle\":\"Cotton AWP/LDP\",\"storySummary\":\"<p class=\\\"news_content\\\">Cotton AWP/LDP                 10/16 06:59\\nWeekly cotton Fine Count Price and Adjustment data.</p>\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-10-16T11:59:45Z\",\"product\":null,\"author\":null,\"thumbNailImage\":null,\"cmsCategoryId\":null,\"dtnpfUrl\":\"\",\"language\":\"en\",\"topic\":\"DTN/Ag\"},{\"id\":\"0700B8E3\",\"links\":{\"article\":{\"href\":\"/publishing/news/articles/0700B8E3\"}},\"title\":\"USDA Daily Market Rates\",\"subTitle\":\"USDA Daily Market Rates\",\"storySummary\":\"<p class=\\\"news_content\\\">USDA Daily Market Rates 10/16\\nDAILY MARKET RATES(GRAIN/MISCELLANEOUS COMMODITIES)</p>\",\"publishDate\":\"2026-10-16T11:23:54Z\",\"product\":null,\"author\":null,\"thumbNailImage\":null,\"cmsCategoryId\":null,\"dtnpfUrl\":\"\",\"language\":\"en\",\"topic\":\"DTN/Ag\"}]"
